# Sources and polling

- One adapter per file under `lib/sources/`. Implement `SourceAdapter` and return `NormalizedJob[]`.
- Failures must throw. `lib/poll.ts` isolates per source. Never let one adapter take down the poll.
- Register new ATS adapters in `lib/sources/index.ts` and the `AtsType` enum. Remote boards are static.
- Workday: `limit` hard-capped at 20. `boardToken` format is `host/tenant/site`.
- LinkedIn is best-effort guest search. Disable with `LINKEDIN_ADAPTER=off`. No login scraping.
- Manual intake (`lib/jobs/from-url.ts`) uses board JSON → JSON-LD → og/meta. No LLM. Failures return 422.
- Manual adds are never geo-dropped (bucket falls back to REMOTE/TORONTO).
- Location policy: Toronto always in; GTA-commutable in; else only if remote.
- Dedupe: fingerprint → source-ID → normalized title+company, plus end-of-poll sweep.
